=== plain-80: width 80, height 24, profile notty, dark, glyphs ascii, plain
# play environment/alpine324 -----------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Play mode: hardn's own screens and prompts, on the real$
# plan/apply engine against a simulated host, hostfake's$
# recording host.System, whose commands a model of the host$
# answers. Nothing on this machine changes: every command and$
# file is the fake's, and its record is shown when play ends.$
$
# Info: environment/alpine324$
# web-01.example.net runs Alpine 3.24 after setup-alpine, doas;$
# alice is in wheel. alice ran doas hardn. /etc/doas.d/20-$
# wheel.conf says permit persist :wheel. hardn has no rule for$
# alice, so item 1 refuses before asking.$
$
# Environment Variable Settings ################################$
$
# HARDN_CONFIG -------------------------------------------------$
$
   -  User                 alice$
  [ ] Under doas           Not kept by hardn$
   -  Value                Not set$
$
  Select an option$
$
   1) Under doas           Keep HARDN_CONFIG$
   2) Guide                How to set HARDN_CONFIG$
$
   0) Return$
$
  > Enter selection [0-2 or q]: 1$
$
# Warning$
# hardn has no doas rule for alice to keep HARDN_CONFIG on. Add$
# setenv { HARDN_CONFIG } to the rule that lets alice use doas.$
# Under doas stays Not kept by hardn.$
$
# Environment Variable Settings ################################$
$
# HARDN_CONFIG -------------------------------------------------$
$
   -  User                 alice$
  [ ] Under doas           Not kept by hardn$
   -  Value                Not set$
$
  Select an option$
$
   1) Under doas           Keep HARDN_CONFIG$
   2) Guide                How to set HARDN_CONFIG$
$
   0) Return$
$
  > Enter selection [0-2 or q]: 0$
$
# simulated system ---------------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Nothing was applied.$
$

